    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Ahasiya jwa ku Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluya ŵane ŵayice kukwawulaga ŵanace wosope ŵacalume ŵa Mwenye Yeholamu nambo ŵamlesile Ahasiya pakuŵapo ŵaliji jwamnondi. Myoyo ŵandu ŵa ku Yelusalemu ŵamjinjisye ucimwene Ahasiya m'malo mwa babagwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pandaŵi jiŵajinjilaga ucimwene, Ahasiya ŵakwete yaka 22 nipo ŵalamulile ku Yelusalemu caka cimo. Nombe nawo Ahasiya ŵakuyaga ndamo ja liŵasa lya Ahabu, pakuŵapo mamagwe Ataliya ŵele ŵaliji cisukulu ca Mwenye Omuli ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵapangaga lunda ŵelewo lwakusakala lwele lwamtendekasisye kuti atendeje yakusakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.2+2CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.2",
              "2CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakweju ŵalemwecesye AMBUJE,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ligongo lyakuti piŵawile babagwe, ŵandu ŵane ŵa mwiŵasa lya Mwenye Ahabu ŵampangaga jwalakwejo lunda lwakusakala lwele lwatendesye kuti alepele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwejo ŵakuyisye lunda lwa jemanjajo, nipo ŵajile kupwatikana ni asilikali ŵa mwenye Yolamu jwa ku Isalaeli ni cakulinga cakuti akamenyane ni asilikali ŵa Mwenye Hasaele ŵa ku Siliya. Asilikaliŵa ŵamenyanilaga ku Lamoti ku Giliyadi nipo Yolamu ŵawulele pakumenyanako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo jwalakwejo ŵawujile ku msinda wa Yesilele kuti gakapole kaje maŵanga giŵawulelego, nipo Yeholamu piŵaliji kweleko Ahasiya ŵajile kukwasonda ŵalakwewo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo kulepela kwa Ahasiya, Mlungu ŵaliji ali akulinganyisye kala kupitila mu ulendo uŵajile kukwasonda Yolamu. Ahasiya piŵaliji mkunguluka ni Yolamu, mundu jwine jwakolanjidwa Yehu mwanace jwa Nimishi jwayice, jwele juŵamsagwile AMBUJE kuti ajonanje liŵasa lya Ahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu piŵaliji mkwawula kupeleka cilango ku liŵasa lya Ahabu, jwalakwe ŵasimangene ni likuga lya ŵandu, mwikugamo ŵapali acimlongola ŵa ku Yuda, ni ŵanace ŵa Ahasiya ŵele ŵalongene ni Ahasiyawo pa ulendo. Nipo Yehu ŵawuleje wosopewo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵasosilesosile Ahasiya nipo kaneko ŵasimene ŵalakwewo ku Samaliya kwele kuŵajuŵile. Ŵajigele nipo ŵapite nawo kwa Yehu kwele kuŵawuleje. Ŵandu ŵasicile cile cakwe m'malembe pakuŵapo Mwenye Yehoshafati ŵaŵaliji angangagwe ŵatumicilaga AMBUJE ni mtima wawo wesope. Sambano mwiŵasa lya Ahasiya mwaliji mwangali mundu jwakuti aŵe mwenye jwakulamulila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Ataliya jwa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Ataliya mamagwe Mwenye Ahasiya piŵapikene ya ciwa ca mwanagwawo, ŵalakwewo ŵawuleje ŵandu wosope ŵa mwiŵasa lya ucimwene wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasiya ŵakwete mlumbugwawo jwakupagwa kwa mama ŵawo ŵanandi lina lyakwe Yehosheba juŵalombedwe ni jwakutaga mbopesi Yehoyada. Jwalakwejo ŵamkulupwisye jumo mwa ŵanace ŵa Ahasiya, lina lyakwe Yowashi, pakumjigala mwanacejo mwakumjiŵa sikati ja ŵanace ŵane ŵa mwenye ŵaŵaliji ciŵandika kuti awulajidwe, nipo ŵamsisile mwanacejo mcipinda ca m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE. Jwalakwejo ŵakulupwisye umi wa mwanacejo ku ciwa kutyocela myala mwa Ataliya pakumsisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanacejo ŵajuŵile ku maloko kwa yaka msano ni cimo, pa ndaŵi jiŵalamulilaga Ataliya mpela mwenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
